{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31372","headline":"和于中丞登越王楼 · 王严","name":"和于中丞登越王楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雉堞临朱槛，登兹便散愁。\n蝉声怨炎夏，山色报新秋。\n江转穿云树，心闲随叶舟。\n仲[宣]徒有叹，谢守几追游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王严","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}